7","term":"크리스마스","zh":"圣诞节","audio":"/audio/44edd2070a34cf676b80.mp3","entryId":"32793","definition":"纪念基督教创始人耶稣诞生的日子，12月25日。","pronunciation":[]},{"id":"1e2cb79b6970d021","term":"더","zh":"更，更加","audio":"/audio/1e2cb79b6970d0213fd9.mp3","entryId":"26829","definition":"与比较对象或某个标准相比，程度加深；在那之上。","pronunciation":["더"]},{"id":"1f9765247406d52d","term":"기다리다","zh":"等，等待","audio":"/audio/1f9765247406d52d5aaa.mp3","entryId":"62264","definition":"直到人、时机到来或某事完成为止，一直打发时间。","pronunciation":["기다리다"]},{"id":"6fde84679c7f2c31","term":"지다","zh":"表示成为前面表达的那样。","audio":"/audio/6fde84679c7f2c315bb0.mp3","entryId":"77247","definition":"表示成为前面表达的那样。","pronunciation":["지다"]}],"audio":"/audio/db019b77ebd29529b61c.mp3","speakerIndex":1}],"difficulty":1.925,"source":{"url":"https://krdict.korean.go.kr/chn/dicSearch/SearchView?ParaWordNo=84276","label":"国立国语院韩国语—汉语学习词典","license":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/2.0/kr/"},"sourceSenseId":"1","sourceLevel":"고급","day":121,"sequenceScore":1.7517,"questions":[{"lineIndex":0,"options":["是吗？那我就更期待圣诞节了。","英洙，我们还是别再见面了吧。分手吧。","据说这次圣诞节会下大雪呢。"],"answer":2},{"lineIndex":1,"options":["是吗？那我就更期待圣诞节了。","据说这次圣诞节会下大雪呢。","英洙，我们还是别再见面了吧。分手吧。"],"answer":0}]}
